# {{ app_name }} site

Privacy notice and support pages in Spanish and English, generated from the `static-site` Copier template.

- `site/` is the folder that gets deployed: plain HTML and CSS, no build step.
- Every paragraph marked `TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN` is text this project must write. Deploys are refused while any marker remains in `site/`.
- Check locally: `grep -rn TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN site/` (no output means ready).
- `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` deploys pull requests as previews and `main` to production on Cloudflare Pages project `{{ pages_project }}`. It needs repository secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`.
- Template updates: `copier update` (answers are in `.copier-answers.yml`; don't edit that file by hand).
